00:01:20.210 --> 00:01:23.570
SuperThischannel asks: What made Kuvira such a monster?

00:01:23.570 --> 00:01:27.200
I would say, you know, she started out with
good intentions and then just kinda fell down

00:01:27.200 --> 00:01:28.310
