00:01:42.210 --> 00:01:44.500
And then sometimes you find out they
were lying all along and they never

00:01:44.500 --> 00:01:45.590
wanted to help you.

00:01:45.590 --> 00:01:49.400
they just wanted power for themselves.
Based on episode 10 it does seem like 

00:01:49.400 --> 00:01:51.030
Kuvira is just out for power.

00:01:51.030 --> 00:01:54.050
She gave that rousing speech about taking
back Earth Kingdom land

00:01:54.050 --> 00:01:58.290
