wandered off.

00:02:36.160 --> 00:02:40.070
Until confirmed dead just presume that
she is alive out there somewhere.

00:02:40.070 --> 00:02:44.200
And given the speech that Toph gave about
leaving things to the younger folks.

00:02:44.200 --> 00:02:48.180
I don't expect to see her in the finale.
They did say that they would be bringing

00:02:48.180 --> 00:02:51.640
